{"3543340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clinch Legends", "steam_appid": 3543340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/af1c1427417658d5edd3c1aa62e47778.avif?t=1788246000\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some search for their relatives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a competition. Play through story campaigns for each hero to unravel the tournament's true purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/8957af3daf55d79cd2509f40be67e09b.poster.avif?t=1788246000\" width=780 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/8957af3daf55d79cd2509f40be67e09b.webm?t=1788246000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/8957af3daf55d79cd2509f40be67e09b.mp4?t=1788246000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/95f5da40f46a84e3d191bc9e22354dd4.avif?t=1788246000\" width=780 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles in Clinch Legends are intense, thoughtful, and merciless. Your resources are limited. Every action requires careful consideration. Any mistake could be your last.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own fighting style with a flexible talent system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stamina and position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the perfect moment to strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvise when your plan falls apart.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/dbdf1264b308b518d1a476a89a7fcb30.avif?t=1788246000\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroes' paths intersect in villages, forests and battlefields, revealing different sides of the world and the characters who inhabit it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disgraced warrior searching for the traitors who destroyed his squad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young templar dreaming of glory beyond his village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young mechanic girl left alone under tragic circumstances.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/bae36b470bda42d94fff18de0ab721dd.poster.avif?t=1788246000\" width=780 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/bae36b470bda42d94fff18de0ab721dd.webm?t=1788246000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/bae36b470bda42d94fff18de0ab721dd.mp4?t=1788246000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/cea5b6261b5e446d30cf680b129591bf.avif?t=1788246000\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions matter. If you blow up a bridge playing as an engineer, other heroes will have to find a way around it. The world remembers your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three characters—three perspectives on one legend. And only by bringing their stories together will you discover the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living world inspired by Scandinavian and Slavic folklore. Villages full of rumors and secrets, dangerous forests where travelers disappear, people trying to survive under the pressure of war.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weave your hero into the overall narrative. Reach the arena. Or die trying.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/af1c1427417658d5edd3c1aa62e47778.avif?t=1788246000\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some search for their relatives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a competition. Play through story campaigns for each hero to unravel the tournament's true purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/8957af3daf55d79cd2509f40be67e09b.poster.avif?t=1788246000\" width=780 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/8957af3daf55d79cd2509f40be67e09b.webm?t=1788246000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/8957af3daf55d79cd2509f40be67e09b.mp4?t=1788246000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/95f5da40f46a84e3d191bc9e22354dd4.avif?t=1788246000\" width=780 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles in Clinch Legends are intense, thoughtful, and merciless. Your resources are limited. Every action requires careful consideration. Any mistake could be your last.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own fighting style with a flexible talent system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stamina and position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the perfect moment to strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvise when your plan falls apart.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/dbdf1264b308b518d1a476a89a7fcb30.avif?t=1788246000\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroes' paths intersect in villages, forests and battlefields, revealing different sides of the world and the characters who inhabit it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disgraced warrior searching for the traitors who destroyed his squad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young templar dreaming of glory beyond his village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young mechanic girl left alone under tragic circumstances.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/bae36b470bda42d94fff18de0ab721dd.poster.avif?t=1788246000\" width=780 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/bae36b470bda42d94fff18de0ab721dd.webm?t=1788246000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/bae36b470bda42d94fff18de0ab721dd.mp4?t=1788246000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/extras/cea5b6261b5e446d30cf680b129591bf.avif?t=1788246000\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions matter. If you blow up a bridge playing as an engineer, other heroes will have to find a way around it. The world remembers your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three characters—three perspectives on one legend. And only by bringing their stories together will you discover the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living world inspired by Scandinavian and Slavic folklore. Villages full of rumors and secrets, dangerous forests where travelers disappear, people trying to survive under the pressure of war.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weave your hero into the overall narrative. Reach the arena. Or die trying.</strong></h2>", "short_description": "An action/RPG where heroes are rushing to get to the legendary tournament. Each has their own past. But fate has something in store for all of them. Find out who will win!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, German, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/f842720782593839885ef0fa894c23c82a059323/header.jpg?t=1788246000", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/ac623ddb105bcbd8f69dd37aa88fc9b64ff3b01c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788246000", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543340/ac623ddb105bcbd8f69dd37aa88fc9b64ff3b01c/capsule_184x69.jpg